  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Mix ingredients, except sulfur and Na2S・9H2O, and adjust pH to 6.5 with H2SO4. Sterilize by filtration while gassing with H2--CO2 (80:20) gas mixture. Steam sulfur for 3 hr on each of 3 successive days. Neutralize Na2S・9H2O as a 5% solution, and autoclave under a N2 atmosphere. Aseptically and anaerobically add sterile sulfur to the medium under a H2--CO2 (80:20) atmosphere. Prior to inoculation, add the sterile Na2S・9H2O solution. Pressurize inoculated bottles to 100 kPa H2--CO2 (80:20)."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "Use Salt base solution of Medium No. [151] with 17.0 g/L (final) NaCl and 2.5 mg/L (final) KI."
    }
  ]
}

